# UI Compose

Composables render state. ViewModels call use cases only.

```kotlin
// BAD
@Composable
fun AgoraScreen(dao: ActivityDao) { /* query + reschedule */ }

// GOOD
@Composable
fun AgoraScreen(state: AgoraUiState, onComplete: () -> Unit) { /* ... */ }
```

- Material 3; user-facing strings in Portuguese
- Agora: one current activity, next/later without clutter, complete in one tap
- No Room, no day-route engine in UI
